    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρμην-εία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρμηνεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interpretation, explanation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				524b
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				209a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				28.1
			</span></i>; esp. of thoughts by words, <i>expression,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Diog.Apoll.
				1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.3.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῆσθαι τῇ γλώσσῃ πρὸς ἑρμηνείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					660a35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				420b19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Resp.</u>
				476a19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>mediation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Epin.</u>
				984e
			</span></i>; <i>style,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				1
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>an expression,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀκόλουθος ἑ.</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i> : also in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ Πλατωνικαὶ
			ἑ.</span> Plato's <i>gifts of style,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Music,
				<i>expression,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1138a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1144d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>translation,</i> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.141
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τῶν Π̔ωμαϊκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1201.12
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἔχειν</span>
			to <i>mean when translated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.232
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Plot.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
